{"skill":{"slug":"ws-excel","displayName":"Excel"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1773158278043,"changelog":"ws-excel 1.0.0\n\n- Initial release.\n- Enables reading and writing Excel files.\n- Supports data cleaning, formula calculation, and multi-sheet operations.\n- Triggered by keywords such as Excel, 表格, csv, xlsx.\n- Handles files located at /workspace/data/analytics/.","changelogSource":"auto","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":1133,"sha256":"6110382403524c40d53105202cefe17aa7741dfb7fe368e7e1375e86dd2f21c4","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1532,"sha256":"3a11d5220339d3a279f9893c47e389dfc3b3cf55bff7ee3e143c25dce0717a01","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789139942329,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"b17a59792f28b761cb64ef1e7e65728a8a3a8968dd4772bf8e178d4f0067598b","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/b17a59792f28b761cb64ef1e7e65728a8a3a8968dd4772bf8e178d4f0067598b","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780085864609},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":42,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":4,"checkedAt":1789139942329},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a simple Excel-helper skill whose disclosed behavior matches its purpose, with no evidence of hidden execution, persistence, credential access, or exfiltration.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The only environment detail is a declared data location under /workspace/data/analytics/, which is proportionate for spreadsheet processing and does not indicate broad local indexing or unrelated data access.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The inspected artifact is a single Markdown skill file with no bundled executable scripts, install hooks, remote retrieval commands, or dependency installation steps.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The triggers include broad terms such as Excel, csv, xlsx, and 表格, and the write capability is not paired with an explicit overwrite warning, so users should give clear file-operation instructions.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No artifact evidence shows persistence mechanisms, privilege escalation, credential/session use, background workers, tool hijacking, or system modification.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill says it helps process Excel files, including reading/writing workbooks, data cleaning, formula calculation, and multi-sheet handling; these capabilities are coherent with an Excel/data-analysis purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install this if you want a Chinese-language Excel assistant. Because it can write spreadsheets, give explicit instructions about whether changes should be saved in place or to a new file, especially for business or financial workbooks.","findings":"[YR4] unexpected: The match appears tied to AIGC metadata ReservedCode fields in the front matter; the inspected file contains no exploit instructions, tool-schema poisoning behavior, or executable payload.\n[SQP-1] expected: The broad spreadsheet-related triggers are expected for an Excel skill, though they could cause over-activation in an automatic router.\n[SQP-2] expected: Read/write Excel behavior is central to the stated purpose; the absence of an explicit overwrite warning is a user-guidance issue rather than evidence of hidden or unsafe behavior.\n[SQP-3] expected: The skill text is in Chinese, which limits accessibility for some users but does not create a security concern.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789139942329}}}}}